# This repo is just our own project code (controller, simulations, scripts,
# docs) plus the small text/CSV/XML result artifacts those simulations
# produce. NS-3 and OFSwitch13 themselves are NOT in this repo -- they're
# cloned separately into WSL per documentation/environment.md.

# Packet captures are large binary files regenerated by re-running a
# simulation (scripts/sync-build-run.sh) -- not worth tracking.
results/**/*.pcap

# Our own run logs (tee output from sync-build-run.sh) -- regenerable.
/logs/*.log

# OS / editor noise (this folder lives on a Windows/OneDrive path)
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Python bytecode cache (scripts/analysis/generate_graphs.py)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
